type.description:
Set only the payload whose key equals type (text, caption and divider use text). Types:
actions: Up to 4 buttons: respond sends a reply to you; approval and entity act on the bound item. Example: {"id":"next","type":"actions","actions":[{"id":"yes","label":"Switch plan","kind":"respond","value":"Switch me to Plus"}]}
caption: Small print under a visual (sources, assumptions). Example: {"id":"src","type":"caption","text":"Prices checked today."}
carousel: 2-10 swipeable cards, e.g. recipes or places. Example: {"id":"c1","type":"carousel","children":[…]}
chart: Trend or distribution of numbers. Example: {"id":"spend","type":"chart","summary":"Spending rose each month.","chart":{"kind":"bar","xLabel":"Month","yLabel":"£","series":[{"name":"Spend","points":[{"label":"Jan","value":120},{"label":"Feb","value":140}]}]}}
diagram: Boxes and arrows positioned with x/y. Example: {"id":"flow","type":"diagram","summary":"Water evaporates, condenses and falls as rain.","diagram":{"nodes":[{"id":"a","label":"Evaporation","x":0,"y":0},{"id":"b","label":"Rain","x":200,"y":0}],"edges":[{"from":"a","to":"b"}]}}
divider: Visual break, optionally labelled. Example: {"id":"d1","type":"divider"}
form: Structured input the user submits once. Example: {"id":"prefs","type":"form","summary":"Asks for budget and dates.","form":{"fields":[{"id":"budget","type":"number","label":"Budget","min":0}],"submitLabel":"Send"}}
grid: Children side by side in 2-4 columns. Example: {"id":"g1","type":"grid","grid":{"columns":2},"children":[…]}
section: Group of children under the component title. Example: {"id":"s1","type":"section","title":"Your options","children":[…]}
stat_row: 1-4 headline numbers. Example: {"id":"saving","type":"stat_row","summary":"Switching saves £96 a year.","stat_row":{"stats":[{"label":"Yearly saving","value":96,"format":"currency","currency":"GBP","trend":"down","goodDirection":"down"}]}}
table: Exact values in rows and columns. Example: {"id":"plans","type":"table","summary":"Three plans by price and data.","table":{"columns":["Plan","Price"],"rows":[["Basic","£10"],["Plus","£15"]]}}
tabs: 2-5 alternative views, e.g. Simple / Detailed. Example: {"id":"t1","type":"tabs","tabs":[{"label":"Simple","children":[…]},{"label":"Detailed","children":[…]}]}
text: Short markdown block (GFM, no HTML). Example: {"id":"lead","type":"text","text":"You use about **half** the data you pay for."}
